{"id": "2842498", "name": "התמרת לפלס של מד\"ר סדר שני עם מקדמים פולינומיים – בלי לפתור", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "solDs", "params": ["e"], "body": "diff(e,s)+diff(e,solY0)*solY1+diff(e,solY1)*solY2"}, {"name": "solXn", "params": ["e", "k"], "body": "if k=0 then e else if k=1 then expand(-solDs(e)) else expand(solDs(solDs(e)))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה המד\"ר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:0}}\\]</p><p>ותנאי התחלה:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(y({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}},\\quad y'({{CT:1}})={{CT:3}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>התמרת לפלס של המד\"ר ותנאי ההתחלה הנ\"ל היא מהצורה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[f_2(s)\\cdot Y''(s)+f_1(s)\\cdot Y'(s) +f_0(s)\\cdot Y(s)+g(s)=0\\]</p><p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y(s)\\)</span> היא התמרת לפלס של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>. מצאו את הפונקציות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_2,f_1,f_0,g\\)</span> (שימו לב שהמשתנה הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span>).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(f_2(s)= \\) [[input:ansf2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ansf2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(f_1(s)= \\) [[input:ansf1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ansf1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(f_0(s)= \\) [[input:ansf0]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ansf0]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(g(s)= \\) [[input:ansg]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ansg]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מתמירים כל מחובר: מכפלה בחזקה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> הופכת לנגזרת לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span>, ואז אוספים את המקדמים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y''\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y'\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — כלי ההתמרה</b><br>מכפלה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^n\\)</span> הופכת לגזירה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\left\\{x^nf(x)\\right\\}=(-1)^n\\frac{d^n}{ds^n}F(s)\\)</span>. בנוסף, עם תנאי ההתחלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(0)={{CT:2}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'(0)={{CT:3}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathcal{L}\\left\\{y\\right\\}=Y(s),\\qquad \\mathcal{L}\\left\\{y^{\\prime}\\right\\}={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\mathcal{L}\\left\\{y^{\\prime\\prime}\\right\\}={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — התמרת כל מחובר</b><br>גוזרים לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span> (כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> תלויה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span>) כמספר הפעמים שמופיעה החזקה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathcal{L}\\left\\{{{CT:6}}\\right\\}={{CT:7}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathcal{L}\\left\\{{{CT:8}}\\right\\}={{CT:9}} \\]</p>ולאיברים בלי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>, לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\left\\{1\\right\\}=\\frac{1}{s}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\left\\{x^n\\right\\}=\\frac{n!}{s^{n+1}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathcal{L}\\left\\{{{CT:10}}\\right\\}={{CT:11}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — איסוף לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y'',Y',Y\\)</span></b><br>מכפילים במקדמים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:12}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:13}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:14}}\\)</span> ומחברים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:15}}=0 \\]</p>ומכאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f_2(s)={{CT:16}},\\qquad f_1(s)={{CT:17}},\\qquad f_0(s)={{CT:18}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ g(s)={{CT:19}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ansf0", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansf1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansf2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansg", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correctf2: is(equal(radcan(coeff_Y2),radcan(ansf2)));\ncorrectf1: is(equal(radcan(coeff_Y1),radcan(ansf1)));\ncorrectf0: is(equal(radcan(coeff_Y),radcan(ansf0)));\ncorrectg: is(equal(radcan(coeff_free),radcan(ansg)));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correctf2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צדקת ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_2\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">טעית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_2\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correctf1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צדקת ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_1\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">טעית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_1\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correctf0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צדקת ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_0\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">טעית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_0\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correctg", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">צדקת ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">טעית ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["L_expr", "L_ode", "a", "b", "c", "coeff_Y", "coeff_Y1", "coeff_Y2", "coeff_free", "d", "n", "n1", "n2", "ode", "solT1", "solT2", "solTf", "solTot", "x0", "y0", "y1", "ys"], "nvariants": 50}